      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "scene_setup"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T03",
      "speaker_id": "A",
      "text_en": "People assume the stream is dead because it looks muddy. The measurements show a repeated rise in suspended sediment immediately after heavy rain; oxygen levels have generally remained within our expected range.",
      "meaning_vi": "A: Vấn đề trước mắt là bùn cặn tăng sau mưa lớn, không phải thiếu oxy.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T04",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "More trees could help in the long term, but most of the muddy runoff currently enters through two uncovered storm drains. Planting alone will not intercept those discharges.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Trồng cây không đủ vì nước bẩn vào suối qua hai cống thoát mưa.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T05",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "The rainfall record has several storms of different sizes. If we compare a tiny shower before the trial with a major storm afterwards, the intervention will look worse for the wrong reason.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Phải so trận mưa tương đương; trận mưa nhỏ và lớn cho kết quả khác không do biện pháp.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "critical_discussion"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T06",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "The hydrograph helps explain why a single dry-day reading hides the problem.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Biểu đồ dòng chảy cho thấy số đo ngày khô dễ che vấn đề.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "peer_response"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T07",
      "speaker_id": "C",
      "text_en": "A small sediment trap beside the upper drain would be reversible and easy to monitor. A dam would interfere with flow, and moving the path would not address the source.",
      "meaning_vi": "C: Thử bẫy giữ bùn cạnh cống phía trên vì có thể tháo bỏ và dễ theo dõi.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T08",
      "speaker_id": "A",
      "text_en": "Do not just take one clear-water photograph after installation. Record sediment readings upstream and downstream before and after comparable rain events.",
      "meaning_vi": "A: Đánh giá bằng đo lượng bùn trước sau các đợt mưa tương đương ở trên và dưới dòng.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T09",
      "speaker_id": "C",
      "text_en": "We should photograph the trap after each storm, alongside the numerical measurements.",
      "meaning_vi": "C: Sau mỗi trận mưa nên chụp bẫy cùng với số đo.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "peer_response"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T10",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "The trap might work technically, but someone must empty it after storms. Unless the council funds regular removal, it will simply fill up and stop functioning.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Lo ngại còn lại là kinh phí và người dọn bùn định kỳ.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T11",
      "speaker_id": "C",
      "text_en": "Those after-rain samples identify the peak pollution episodes and form the strongest evidence for evaluating the trial.",
      "meaning_vi": "C: Mẫu nước sau mưa là bằng chứng chính về đợt ô nhiễm cao.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T12",
      "speaker_id": "C",
      "text_en": "The council asked if this would stop every flood. It cannot, and our report should say so. We are testing sediment reduction at one drain, not solving the catchment’s entire flood risk.",
      "meaning_vi": "C: Không thể hứa biện pháp ngăn mọi trận lũ vì chỉ xử lý bùn ở một cống.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "critical_discussion"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T13",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "The photographs help locate where flooding is noticed, but light and camera settings make the water colour unsuitable as a scientific measurement.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Ảnh cư dân chỉ giúp xác định nơi ngập, không đo được độ đục.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T14",
      "speaker_id": "A",
      "text_en": "Check that the monitoring method is manageable for council staff as well as for students.",
      "meaning_vi": "A: Cách theo dõi phải phù hợp khả năng nhân viên hội đồng.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
